<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8231" root="حصرم" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُحَصْرَمٌ</span></b>  Butter <i>dissundered,</i> or <i>separated</i> [<i>into
clots</i>], <i>by reason of intense cold; not coalescing;</i>
(K;) [as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتَحَصْرِمٌ</span></b> : see Q. 2.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  A <i>scanty,</i>
or <i>small,</i> gift. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  Anything <i>straitened,</i> or
<i>scanted.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِصْرِمٌ</span>, in two places. ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَاعِرٌ مُحَصْرَمٌ</span> <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُخَضْرَمٌ</span>, (K,) which is the
more common term; meaning <i>A poet that lived
in the time of paganism and in that of El-Islám.</i>
(TA.)

